 "description": "Busy makes free, private tools for work and life, in suites: Busy Business (thirteen tools for small businesses and freelancers to grow and run the business: a marketing studio with a brand profile and a year plan, a brand kit, projects, invoices and quotes, time, receipts, money, clients, documents, subscriptions, trips and stock), Busy Growth (free tools to grow your career: a library, skills, wins, a job tracker, a CV and LinkedIn builder and more), Busy Home (free tools for household paperwork: documents with expiry reminders, contracts with the last day to cancel, upkeep, a home inventory, letters, moving and a Just in Case binder) and Busy Games (free daily brain games). Each suite is a free app for Mac and Windows, or runs in the browser, and keeps everything in the owner's own folder, with no account and no subscription. Each suite can have a paid AI expert: Olaf for business, Ivy for professional growth, Juno for household paperwork.",
